# CONFLICT, deliberately left in place rather than resolved here.
#
# This unanchored `data/` undoes the anchored `/data/` above, whose comment
# says it was anchored "so they don't hide src/ahriuwu/data/ etc." -- and it
# does hide them: `src/ahriuwu/data/` has 9 tracked files that survive only
# because they were added before this line existed. Any NEW file under any
# `data/` directory anywhere in the tree is silently untracked, which is how
# `lanerl_jax/data/` went missing from a commit.
#
# Not deleted here because this file is shared with every other worktree and
# the fix belongs to whoever owns it. Negating the paths that need it instead.
data/
!lanerl_jax/data/
!src/ahriuwu/data/
!scratchpad/.gitkeep
recordings/
wandb

# --- lanerl (lane-rl/spike) heavy artifacts: NEVER commit -------------------
# lanerl/ alone is ~4.2 GB of screen captures, frame dumps and state records.
# Source and configs are tracked; recorded output is reproducible, so it is not.
lanerl/logs/
lanerl/frames*/
lanerl/cam*/
lanerl/probe*/
lanerl/winshots/
lanerl/shots/
lanerl/diag/
*.mp4
*.jsonl
*.tgz
*.npz
lanerl_bot/bench/out/*.log
lanerl_rl/artifacts/
lanerl_bot/tests/artifacts/

# JAX work: a venv layered over the shared `ml` conda env (see
# lanerl_jax/sim/tests/conftest.py). Local tooling, never committed.
.venv-jax/
